     <P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 26.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: black; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">教育教学研究院对</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: black; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">市属学校<SPAN lang=EN-US>2010</SPAN>年绍兴市教科规划课题结<SPAN style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: line; LETTER-SPACING: 1.5pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold">的</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt">验收工作已于日前结束。我校有六项市级课题参与了结题验收，其中<B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal">《中小学教师隐性流失现状及影响研究——以绍兴为例》、《新课程高中物理实验与理性探究教学》和《全国信息学奥林匹克竞赛平台建设研究》</B>三项课题结题定级为优秀。请各课题负责人于<SPAN lang=EN-US>4</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>19</SPAN>日下午<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>：<SPAN lang=EN-US>30</SPAN>到教育教学研究院三楼会议室参加会议，沈江峰院长将对参评市优秀成果的课题材料作具体申报指导。<SPAN lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: black; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">     </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: black; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">各课题负责人请将参加市优秀成</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: black; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">果评审的课题材料按要求整理好后于<SPAN lang=EN-US>4</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>22</SPAN>日中午前送教育研究院办公室吴娩老师处。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: right" align=right><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: black; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">二<SPAN lang=EN-US>0</SPAN>一<SPAN lang=EN-US>0</SPAN>年四月十八日<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
